---
title: Market data - the snapshot, the panel, and what a model must beat
---
flowchart TB
    Universe[Universe<br/>S&P 500 file + AI-infra overlay<br/>+ sector ETFs, with themes] --> Refresh[Snapshot refresh<br/>paced, per-ticker failures captured]
    Yahoo[(Yahoo chart endpoint<br/>browser-impersonated TLS)] --> Refresh
    Refresh --> Store[(As-of parquet store<br/>bars + corporate actions<br/>one immutable partition per fetch day)]
    Refresh -.-> Drop[Live session dropped:<br/>only closed bars are stored]

    Edgar[(SEC EDGAR<br/>8-K events, XBRL company facts,<br/>press-release exhibits)] --> Filings[EDGAR layer<br/>earliest-filed facts, derived Q4,<br/>reaction windows, point in time]
    Filings --> Store
    Filings --> Reader[Release reader<br/>DeepSeek V4 Flash scores what<br/>the company states: outlook, demand,<br/>pricing, capex, supply]
    Reader --> Store
    Store --> Panel[Panel<br/>sessions x tickers, shared calendar<br/>theme baskets = equal-weight members]
    Store --> Extras[Filing features<br/>growth, margins, capex, drift,<br/>release tone, all dated by filing]
    Extras --> Baselines
    Extras --> Windows
    Panel --> Book[Sizing<br/>inverse-vol, name and theme caps,<br/>vol target, full exits]
    Book --> Report
    Panel --> Baselines[Baselines<br/>momentum · relative strength<br/>theme momentum · fundamental blend]
    Panel --> Windows[Window tensors<br/>8 raw channels, forward labels,<br/>label end dates for purging]
    Baselines --> Harness[Walk-forward harness<br/>rank IC vs residual return<br/>long-short net of cost, purged folds]
    Windows --> Model[Learned rankers<br/>mlp · gru · xsect · master · lgbm<br/>purged walk-forward, seed ensembles]
    Model -.-> Harness
    Harness --> Report([Sweep table and book report<br/>every score on the same sessions, net of cost])
    Panel --> Pilot[Daily growth pilot<br/>neural scorer + sequential RL<br/>delayed funded execution, CPU or CUDA]
    Pilot --> Research[(Separate research artifacts<br/>frozen models, NAV paths, regime splits<br/>no automatic promotion)]
    Research --> Forward[Frozen NumPy neural inference<br/>independent prospective accounts]
    Panel --> Forward

    Store -. pinned partitions .-> Pinned[Authenticated study inputs<br/>unchanged report + verified source hashes<br/>separate QQQ panel, complete XNYS grid]
    Research -. pinned original report .-> Pinned
    Pinned --> Assembly[Price-only gate assembly<br/>22 price / basket features<br/>gross open-to-open proxy labels<br/>unchanged baskets, source-global cadence]
    Assembly --> Nested[Nested chronological ridge<br/>dated observations and fixed basket proxies<br/>past-only fits + inner funded selection]
    Nested --> Outer[Continuous outer instructions<br/>stock / SPY / QQQ / cash<br/>research only, no live policy change]
    Outer --> Study[Matched six-account study<br/>candidate + no-gate + unchanged /3<br/>funded SPY / QQQ + equal weight<br/>10 / 25 bp, one shared calendar]
    Assembly --> Study
    Study --> Journal
    Panel --> Accounts[Research accounts<br/>desk · fixed-model · stock/index/cash adapter<br/>SPY and QQQ funded controls]
    Accounts -. optional observation .-> Journal[Cash and fill journal<br/>decisions, phase changes, actual fills<br/>fees, every close mark, terminal holdings]
    Journal --> Research
    Research --> Audit[Independent replay + verification CLI<br/>retained JSON source hashes<br/>cash, units, fees and NAV reconciled]
    Audit -. verified study account marks .-> Scorecards[Strict research scorecards<br/>full + rolling + actual folds + causal regimes<br/>exploratory, no automatic adoption]
    Scorecards --> Research
    StudyCLI[CLI: market_nested_study<br/>fresh archive + readback verification<br/>never overwrites a prior study] -.-> Pinned
    StudyCLI -.-> Study
    Audit -.-> Limits

    Primary[(Historical primary documents<br/>issuer filings + SEC accession indexes)] --> Cohort[Offline reviewed-cohort importer<br/>stable issuer + share-class identities<br/>publication bounds separate from effective dates]
    Manifest[Declared cohort + local source manifest<br/>URLs, SHA256, quoted passages, ingestion times<br/>no inferred feature values] --> Cohort
    Cohort --> Evidence[(Fresh immutable research archive<br/>original bytes + original manifest<br/>hash-addressed source copies)]
    Evidence --> Readiness[Read-back readiness report<br/>all names on every XNYS session<br/>membership, feature and settlement gaps]
    Readiness -.-> Limits[Integrity is not historical completeness<br/>cash entitlement is not funded cash<br/>no backtest readiness or automatic promotion]
    CohortCLI[CLI: market_historical_cohort<br/>offline import + readiness only] -.-> Cohort

    CLI[CLI: market_snapshot · market_edgar<br/>market_tone · market_sweep · market_book] -.-> Refresh
    CLI -.-> Report

    Rule[A pinned as-of snapshot is reproducible,<br/>not proof of historical availability.<br/>Partitions stay immutable; label endpoints are purged]
    Rule -.-> Store
    Rule -.-> Windows

